{"text": "She did not stop to ask whether the joy that held her was a monstrous one, for she felt that the question did not matter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She knew that she would weep again when she saw the kind, tender hands folded in death and the loving face fixed and gray. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But beyond that bitter moment lay a long procession of years to come, which would belong to her absolutely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She opened and spread her arms out to them in welcome, ready to greet every one of those coming years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There would be no one to live for but herself, and no powerful will would ever again bend hers with blind persistence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whether the intention was kind or cruel, she now saw that forcing ones will on another person was no less a crime. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And yet she had loved him, sometimes, though often she had not, and in this new moment it hardly seemed to matter at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What could love, that unsolved mystery, count for in the face of this self assertion, which she suddenly recognized as the strongest feeling of her being. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Free, Body and soul free, she kept whispering to herself, as though the words were a prayer.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "w", "h", "e", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "j", "o", "y", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "m", "o", "n", "s", "t", "r", "o", "u", "s", " ", "o", "n", "e", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "f", "e", "l", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "q", "u", "e", "s", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "m", "a", "t", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", 